(Oceanic Maritime Logistics - Employee Benefits and Wellness Guide) '
(Document Ref: OML-HR-POL-02 | Classification: Internal) '
(Section 1: Healthcare and Insurance Coverage) '
(Healthcare coverage provider: Oceanic Maritime Comprehensive Health Plan.) '
(Employer contribution: Company pays 85% of monthly healthcare premium for employees and 65% for enrolled dependents.) '
(Primary care consultation copayment: $25 flat copay per in-network visit.) '
(Specialist consultation copayment: $40 flat copay per in-network specialist visit.) '
(Dental coverage maximum: Comprehensive dental allowance provides up to $1,200 annual maximum coverage per member.) '
(Optical allowance: $300 annual benefit for prescription eyewear or contact lenses.) '
(Group term life insurance: Employer provides basic life insurance equal to 2x basic annual earnings up to a $500,000 maximum.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
