14 TL
(Section 2: Wellness, Education, and Retirement Programs) '
(Annual wellness stipend: $600 per calendar year reimbursed for gym memberships, fitness trackers, or ergonomic home equipment.) '
(Mental health support: 8 free confidential counseling sessions per calendar year through the Employee Assistance Program \(EAP\).) '
(Retirement 401\(k\) plan: Company matches 100% of employee retirement contributions up to 5% of gross base salary.) '
(Retirement vesting: Employer matching contributions vest immediately at 100% upon payroll deposit.) '
(Tuition reimbursement cap: Up to $3,500 per calendar year for approved job-related accredited coursework.) '
(Tuition grade requirement: Reimbursement requires successful course completion with Grade B \(3.0 GPA\) or equivalent.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
